    <briefdescription>
<para>Combined hash + equality functor for variable-size monomials, plugged into the <computeroutput>std::unordered_set</computeroutput> inside <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomial_set_var_size" kindref="compound">MonomialSetVarSize</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads the leading int of each monomial as its length, then compares the two ranges with <computeroutput>std::equal</computeroutput>. The hash is the same <computeroutput>TODO</computeroutput> stub that returns 0 as in the fixed-size variant. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
